{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13378","headline":"让皇帝庙乐章 酌献 · 李纾","name":"让皇帝庙乐章 酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八音具举，三寿既盥。\n洁兹宗彝，瑟彼圭瓒。\n兰肴重错，椒醑飘散。\n降祚维城，永爲藩翰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李纾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}